   "Mf": "SECOND order: Mf reaches nothing but z = newm[0] -> kappa(z) -> the face permeability of c and N, which are updated at the END of the step. rho only sees it on the NEXT step, through the chemotactic flux _face_flux(rho, c) and through g's dependence on N.",
